# Formspree form ID: the part after https://formspree.io/f/
#
# OPTIONAL. The live form ID is committed in src/data/company.ts, so the
# contact form and the PrimeTIPS signup work in a fresh clone and in any
# deployment with no environment configuration at all.
#
# Set this only to point an environment at a DIFFERENT form, for example a
# throwaway form for a staging deploy so test submissions do not reach the
# sales inbox. It overrides the committed default.
#
# It is not a secret: the ID is the form's POST target, so it is present in the
# HTML of every deployed page regardless.
PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
